            "text": "<p>Picture a candlelit aisle, flickering bulk taper candles casting a romantic glow as they line your path. Or imagine them as part of a stunning table centerpiece, their sleek shape adding sophistication to every corner. Whether for intimate ceremonies or grand receptions, taper candles set the stage for timeless beauty.</p>",
