            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-4-base",
            "text": "<p>As a restaurant or hotel proprietor, you understand that ambiance is priceless. Unscented taper candles are the go-to choice for adding warmth and elegance to dining tables without overwhelming the senses. From cozy cafes to upscale dining rooms, these candles offer the perfect finishing touch, creating an inviting glow that enhances the entire experience.</p>",
